<myopenmath xmlns:pi="http://pretextbook.org/2020/pretext/internal" id="211694">
<statement>
<p>
Suppose that A is the set of all animals and C is the set of all cats. Label each of the following as true or false.
</p>
<p>
<m>\displaystyle{A}\subseteq{C}</m> </p>
<p><ol style="list-style-type:upper-alpha"><li> true</li> 
<li> false</li> 
</ol></p>
<p>
<m>\displaystyle{C}\subseteq{A}</m> </p>
<p><ol style="list-style-type:upper-alpha"><li> true</li> 
<li> false</li> 
</ol></p>

</statement>
<solution>
<p><ul><li>B:  false</li><li>A:  true</li></ul></p>
</solution>
</myopenmath>

